+- [[metals/cadmium]]
+- [[metals/mercury]]
+
+## Verification notes
+
+No DOI was visible in the extracted PDF text. Cadmium is reported as BDL without a visible detection-limit value in the extracted table, so it should not be converted into a numeric zero.
+
