+- [[ingredients/canned-tuna]]
+- [[metals/mercury]]
+- [[metals/lead]]
+
+## Verification notes
+
+The fetched filename classified this as salt total-mercury evidence, but the actual food matrix is canned tuna. Mercury is total mercury; methylmercury is not reported.
+
