+- [[ingredients/coffee]]
+- [[metals/lead]]
+- [[metals/cadmium]]
+
+## Verification notes
+
+The source is a conference proceeding and is assigned B-tier. Because the extracted text does not expose the Pb/Cd LODs, the non-detect results should not be converted into numeric zeros.
+
